OL,3,GNEWSATable tennis group helps black men
OL,4,Atackle mental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat started as a game of table tennis
OL,7,Fat a local community centre is now
OL,8,Fhelping older black men in Birmingham
OL,9,Fopen up about their health, wellbeing
OL,10,Fand life experiences.
OL,12,FThe weekly sessions are organised by
OL,13,Fthe Over 50s Black Men Forum who said
OL,14,Fthe biggest benefit is often the
OL,15,Fconversations that happen away from the
OL,16,Ftable.
OL,18,FKarlus Harris, a tailor who works in
OL,19,Fthe city's Jewellery Quarter said
OL,20,Fplaying at Handsworth Wellbeing Centre
OL,21,Fgives him a sense of community.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
